    "duration": 3.241
  },
  {
    "text": "so let us uh settle in to our posture.",
    "start": 102.479,
    "duration": 6.841
  },
  {
    "text": "So what are the conditions that support",
    "start": 152.959,
    "duration": 5.881
  },
  {
    "text": "love?",
    "start": 155.84,
    "duration": 3.0
  },
  {
    "text": "Some measure of",
