    "duration": 6.039
  },
  {
    "text": "tranquility.",
    "start": 171.519,
    "duration": 3.0
  },
  {
    "text": "And so we uh soothe our heart as we",
    "start": 176.56,
    "duration": 5.64
  },
  {
    "text": "begin",
    "start": 179.2,
    "duration": 3.0
  },
  {
    "text": "some measure of samadei the unification",
    "start": 188.239,
    "duration": 6.441
  },
  {
    "text": "of mind.",
    "start": 191.36,
    "duration": 3.32
  },
  {
    "text": "So we gather ourselves",
    "start": 195.76,
    "duration": 4.119
  },
  {
    "text": "the more still we become, the more",
    "start": 209.599,
    "duration": 9.72
  },
  {
    "text": "uniformly love flavors the mind.",
    "start": 213.12,
    "duration": 6.199
  },
  {
    "text": "Strangely, our our love is supported",
    "start": 256.88,
    "duration": 6.879
  },
  {
    "text": "by our capacity to put",
    "start": 260.799,
    "duration": 7.321
  },
  {
    "text": "the world down temporarily,",
    "start": 263.759,
    "duration": 4.361
  },
  {
    "text": "to relinquish covetousness and distress",
    "start": 269.6,
    "duration": 6.8
  },
  {
    "text": "with respect to the world. It's the",
    "start": 274.32,
    "duration": 4.96
  },
  {
    "text": "Santana",
    "start": 276.4,
    "duration": 5.12
  },
  {
    "text": "reads.",
    "start": 279.28,
    "duration": 2.24
  },
  {
    "text": "We just uh establish some",
    "start": 366.96,
    "duration": 4.6
  },
  {
    "text": "mindfulness.",
    "start": 372.4,
    "duration": 3.0
  },
  {
    "text": "Awake to this moment.",
    "start": 383.36,
    "duration": 3.959
  },
  {
    "text": "Awake to joy. Awake to sorrow.",
    "start": 389.199,
    "duration": 6.201
  },
  {
    "text": "Whatever heaviness is in our heart, we",
    "start": 454.479,
    "duration": 6.761
  },
  {
    "text": "begin to",
    "start": 457.759,
    "duration": 3.481
  },
  {
    "text": "sense that.",
    "start": 462.319,
    "duration": 3.32
  },
  {
    "text": "might be significant, might be quite",
    "start": 472.24,
    "duration": 5.799
  },
  {
    "text": "subtle,",
    "start": 475.039,
    "duration": 3.0
  },
  {
    "text": "might be specific. And it may be just uh",
    "start": 482.319,
    "duration": 6.121
  },
  {
    "text": "the the sorrow of uh",
    "start": 491.52,
    "duration": 5.079
  },
  {
    "text": "of being human.",
    "start": 497.12,
    "duration": 3.479
  },
  {
    "text": "In whatever ways we suffer, whatever",
    "start": 524.56,
    "duration": 5.92
  },
  {
    "text": "ways we are not free, we",
    "start": 527.2,
    "duration": 6.8
  },
  {
    "text": "become willing to have a thoroughly",
    "start": 530.48,
    "duration": 7.28
  },
  {
    "text": "undefended relationship",
    "start": 534.0,
    "duration": 7.2
  },
  {
    "text": "to that suffering.",
    "start": 537.76,
    "duration": 5.84
  },
  {
    "text": "to the whatever heaviness might be",
    "start": 541.2,
    "duration": 5.12
  },
  {
    "text": "there, whatever",
    "start": 543.6,
    "duration": 7.239
  },
  {
    "text": "helplessness might be there.",
    "start": 546.32,
    "duration": 4.519
  },
  {
    "text": "the more vividly",
    "start": 638.0,
    "duration": 9.32
  },
  {
    "text": "soberly we experience our own pain.",
    "start": 641.68,
    "duration": 5.64
  },
  {
    "text": "the more obvious",
    "start": 648.64,
    "duration": 3.72
  },
  {
    "text": "the necessity of love becomes.",
    "start": 652.72,
    "duration": 5.48
  },
  {
    "text": "So we start very",
    "start": 664.16,
    "duration": 7.52
  },
  {
    "text": "close to the ground level of being human",
    "start": 667.68,
    "duration": 8.599
  },
  {
    "text": "that we suffer",
    "start": 671.68,
    "duration": 4.599
  },
  {
    "text": "And then we begin to um",
    "start": 685.519,
    "duration": 7.121
  },
  {
    "text": "pour",
    "start": 690.48,
    "duration": 5.039
  },
  {
    "text": "our uh",
    "start": 692.64,
    "duration": 7.24
  },
  {
    "text": "love into that pain.",
    "start": 695.519,
    "duration": 4.361
  },
  {
    "text": "letting it mix.",
    "start": 700.72,
    "duration": 3.559
  },
  {
    "text": "Letting the love uh",
    "start": 708.8,
    "duration": 7.719
  },
  {
    "text": "bless the pain.",
    "start": 712.88,
    "duration": 3.639
  },
  {
    "text": "Maybe there's uh",
    "start": 732.399,
    "duration": 8.081
  },
  {
    "text": "some visual thinking, visual imagery",
    "start": 735.6,
    "duration": 9.08
  },
  {
    "text": "that supports this process.",
    "start": 740.48,
    "duration": 4.2
  },
  {
    "text": "Maybe you're silently",
    "start": 746.399,
    "duration": 5.12
  },
  {
    "text": "uh",
    "start": 749.6,
    "duration": 6.08
  },
  {
    "text": "whispering words in your own mind to",
    "start": 751.519,
    "duration": 6.56
  },
  {
    "text": "evoke uh",
    "start": 755.68,
    "duration": 5.8
  },
  {
    "text": "the air.",
    "start": 758.079,
    "duration": 3.401
  },
  {
    "text": "the the poignency of uh love meeting",
    "start": 831.519,
    "duration": 8.601
  },
  {
    "text": "suffering",
    "start": 837.12,
    "duration": 3.0
  },
  {
    "text": "becomes a a a kind of home to a",
    "start": 844.32,
    "duration": 6.16
  },
  {
    "text": "Brahma",
    "start": 848.56,
    "duration": 4.92
  },
  {
    "text": "Vhara.",
    "start": 850.48,
    "duration": 3.0
  },
  {
    "text": "It's a sense of protection of that",
    "start": 858.8,
    "duration": 7.399
  },
  {
    "text": "species of love.",
    "start": 862.399,
    "duration": 3.8
  },
  {
    "text": "When we uh come to know how utterly",
    "start": 945.76,
    "duration": 5.199
  },
  {
    "text": "impersonal",
    "start": 948.24,
    "duration": 5.44
  },
  {
    "text": "our suffering is,",
    "start": 950.959,
    "duration": 5.281
  },
  {
    "text": "come to know its universality,",
    "start": 953.68,
    "duration": 6.519
  },
  {
    "text": "come to know it as",
    "start": 956.24,
    "duration": 3.959
  },
  {
    "text": "the thread that uh",
    "start": 960.399,
    "duration": 6.12
  },
  {
    "text": "weaves us together.",
    "start": 967.279,
    "duration": 3.641
  },
  {
    "text": "Becomes more natural",
    "start": 977.68,
    "duration": 7.32
  },
  {
    "text": "uh to begin to uh",
    "start": 980.639,
    "duration": 4.361
  },
  {
    "text": "wish that other beings suffer less.",
    "start": 985.92,
    "duration": 5.479
  },
  {
    "text": "The embraasiveness of cruelty",
    "start": 1019.519,
    "duration": 12.361
  },
  {
    "text": "is so obvious in the light of awareness.",
    "start": 1024.959,
    "duration": 6.921
  },
  {
    "text": "And so we we turn to this uh",
    "start": 1054.559,
    "duration": 7.641
  },
  {
    "text": "this kind of love.",
    "start": 1058.4,
    "duration": 3.8
  },
  {
    "text": "And no, it's not sufficient. No, it's",
    "start": 1073.36,
    "duration": 6.4
  },
  {
    "text": "not the last word.",
    "start": 1076.559,
    "duration": 7.281
  },
  {
    "text": "But do not let either of those facts rob",
    "start": 1079.76,
    "duration": 8.96
  },
  {
    "text": "you of the experience of knowing love",
    "start": 1083.84,
    "duration": 10.12
  },
  {
    "text": "deeply and abiding in it.",
    "start": 1088.72,
    "duration": 5.24
  },
  {
    "text": "Just resting,",
    "start": 1244.32,
    "duration": 3.32
  },
  {
    "text": "softening.",
    "start": 1247.679,
    "duration": 3.0
  },
  {
    "text": "like our body",
    "start": 1268.32,
    "duration": 9.16
  },
  {
    "text": "kind of antenna of sorts and uh",
    "start": 1271.2,
    "duration": 6.28
  },
  {
    "text": "resonating at a certain frequency and",
    "start": 1279.36,
    "duration": 4.88
  },
  {
    "text": "then",
    "start": 1281.919,
    "duration": 5.441
  },
  {
    "text": "radiating broadcasting",
    "start": 1284.24,
    "duration": 7.24
  },
  {
    "text": "the same frequency. See,",
    "start": 1287.36,
    "duration": 4.12
  },
  {
    "text": "just beginning to line up your being",
    "start": 1293.039,
    "duration": 9.64
  },
  {
    "text": "the direction of uh",
    "start": 1298.08,
    "duration": 4.599
  },
  {
    "text": "compassion.",
    "start": 1302.72,
    "duration": 2.4
  },
  {
    "text": "Just resting in such a way that We",
    "start": 1418.88,
    "duration": 9.84
  },
  {
    "text": "plant uh seeds of uh nonviolence and",
    "start": 1423.679,
    "duration": 8.36
  },
  {
    "text": "hard mind.",
    "start": 1428.72,
    "duration": 3.319
  },
  {
    "text": "that we become fundamentally alienated",
    "start": 1439.76,
    "duration": 5.08
  },
  {
    "text": "from cruelty",
    "start": 1446.08,
    "duration": 3.4
  },
  {
    "text": "that our love becomes uh much closer to",
    "start": 1460.96,
    "duration": 7.599
  },
  {
    "text": "the surface.",
    "start": 1465.279,
    "duration": 9.321
  },
  {
    "text": "Just one breath, one memory, one word",
    "start": 1468.559,
    "duration": 6.041
  },
  {
    "text": "and the dharma rushes in.",
    "start": 1475.2,
    "duration": 4.599
  },
  {
    "text": "The love rises up.",
    "start": 1481.84,
    "duration": 4.12
  },
  {
    "text": "Maybe very quiet love.",
    "start": 1488.799,
    "duration": 4.441
  },
  {
    "text": "But love nonetheless.",
    "start": 1498.4,
    "duration": 2.8
  },
  {
    "text": "May my life",
    "start": 1538.96,
    "duration": 8.04
  },
  {
    "text": "be a a cause and condition for",
    "start": 1541.919,
    "duration": 5.081
  },
  {
    "text": "a suffering.",
    "start": 1547.12,
    "duration": 3.32
  },
  {
    "text": "More understanding.",
    "start": 1550.72,
    "duration": 3.4
  },
  {
    "text": "[Music]",
    "start": 1675.54,
    "duration": 3.09
  },
  {
    "text": "Okay, good to practice with you. Um,",
    "start": 1754.159,
    "duration": 5.4
  },
  {
    "text": "just before I um",
    "start": 1759.919,
    "duration": 7.921
  },
  {
    "text": "uh left to to uh to come teach, I was",
    "start": 1764.24,
    "duration": 6.319
  },
  {
    "text": "with my 11-year-old nephew, and I said,",
    "start": 1767.84,
    "duration": 4.719
  },
  {
    "text": "\"I'm I got to go. I got to go. You're",
    "start": 1770.559,
    "duration": 4.24
  },
  {
    "text": "going to teach? Give me a pep talk.\" You",
    "start": 1772.559,
    "duration": 5.041
  },
  {
    "text": "know, he's like, \"What?\" Like, \"Okay,",
    "start": 1774.799,
    "duration": 5.041
  },
  {
    "text": "we're like it's the six bottom of the",
    "start": 1777.6,
    "duration": 5.92
  },
  {
    "text": "six inning baseball.\" He's baseball.",
    "start": 1779.84,
    "duration": 6.319
  },
  {
    "text": "Bottom of the six,",
    "start": 1783.52,
    "duration": 6.24
  },
  {
    "text": "there's a run. We're down one run.",
    "start": 1786.159,
    "duration": 6.081
  },
  {
    "text": "Runner on third.",
    "start": 1789.76,
    "duration": 4.56
  },
  {
    "text": "I'm at bat.",
    "start": 1792.24,
    "duration": 4.0
  },
  {
    "text": "What do you say to me? Give me the pep",
    "start": 1794.32,
    "duration": 5.12
  },
  {
    "text": "talk. and he said, \"You're you're going",
    "start": 1796.24,
    "duration": 6.679
  },
  {
    "text": "to strike out.\"",
    "start": 1799.44,
    "duration": 3.479
  },
  {
    "text": "Told him I would I'd remember that",
    "start": 1804.159,
    "duration": 5.601
  },
  {
    "text": "keeping tabs",
    "start": 1807.679,
    "duration": 4.24
  },
  {
    "text": "these kind of brutal assaults on my",
    "start": 1809.76,
    "duration": 5.159
  },
  {
    "text": "dignity.",
    "start": 1811.919,
    "duration": 3.0
  },
  {
    "text": "So um",
    "start": 1815.12,
    "duration": 3.64
  },
  {
    "text": "so it's uh",
    "start": 1821.2,
    "duration": 7.199
  },
  {
    "text": "it's a good thing to uh",
    "start": 1824.64,
    "duration": 8.159
  },
  {
    "text": "cultivate the capacity uh no matter how",
    "start": 1828.399,
    "duration": 8.081
  },
  {
    "text": "robust but the capacity to have",
    "start": 1832.799,
    "duration": 7.76
  },
  {
    "text": "well-being independent of conditions.",
    "start": 1836.48,
    "duration": 8.4
  },
  {
    "text": "It's one way of talking about freedom.",
    "start": 1840.559,
    "duration": 6.801
  },
  {
    "text": "And",
    "start": 1844.88,
    "duration": 5.84
  },
  {
    "text": "was was recently on on retreat and we",
    "start": 1847.36,
    "duration": 6.48
  },
  {
    "text": "got a question um",
    "start": 1850.72,
    "duration": 6.4
  },
  {
    "text": "asking why why we the teachers weren't",
    "start": 1853.84,
    "duration": 5.04
  },
  {
    "text": "speaking more explicitly about",
    "start": 1857.12,
    "duration": 4.159
  },
  {
    "text": "awakening.",
    "start": 1858.88,
    "duration": 4.48
  },
  {
    "text": "And so I thought to try to speak to",
    "start": 1861.279,
    "duration": 4.4
  },
  {
    "text": "that. What are the pros and cons of",
    "start": 1863.36,
    "duration": 5.84
  },
  {
    "text": "being explicit about awakening?",
    "start": 1865.679,
    "duration": 7.36
  },
  {
    "text": "And what are the the benefits and",
    "start": 1869.2,
    "duration": 9.56
  },
  {
    "text": "complexities of uh such a discussion?",
    "start": 1873.039,
    "duration": 5.721
  },
  {
    "text": "And",
    "start": 1878.799,
    "duration": 5.041
  },
  {
    "text": "it's worth just checking in right now.",
    "start": 1880.88,
    "duration": 6.32
  },
  {
    "text": "What is that word do to your mind? Is it",
    "start": 1883.84,
    "duration": 7.68
  },
  {
    "text": "uplift or confront or",
    "start": 1887.2,
    "duration": 7.68
  },
  {
    "text": "inspire? Or does the mind become dense",
    "start": 1891.52,
    "duration": 6.32
  },
  {
    "text": "with self as we",
    "start": 1894.88,
    "duration": 7.039
  },
  {
    "text": "contemplate awakening?",
    "start": 1897.84,
    "duration": 6.64
  },
  {
    "text": "And of course the the Buddha was not",
    "start": 1901.919,
    "duration": 5.841
  },
  {
    "text": "shy. It was striking how uh forthright",
    "start": 1904.48,
    "duration": 7.36
  },
  {
    "text": "and frequently liberation was discussed.",
    "start": 1907.76,
    "duration": 6.159
  },
  {
    "text": "this beautiful",
    "start": 1911.84,
    "duration": 4.4
  },
  {
    "text": "uh quote from the the Majima Nikkaya.",
    "start": 1913.919,
    "duration": 3.921
  },
  {
    "text": "The purpose of the holy life does not",
    "start": 1916.24,
    "duration": 5.039
  },
  {
    "text": "consist in acquiring benefits, honor or",
    "start": 1917.84,
    "duration": 7.6
  },
  {
    "text": "fame, nor in gaining virtue,",
    "start": 1921.279,
    "duration": 8.161
  },
  {
    "text": "states of concentration nor insight",
    "start": 1925.44,
    "duration": 7.76
  },
  {
    "text": "or the eye of knowledge. The unshakable",
    "start": 1929.44,
    "duration": 6.88
  },
  {
    "text": "deliverance of heart, the shore heart's",
    "start": 1933.2,
    "duration": 6.64
  },
  {
    "text": "release. This and this alone. It's the",
    "start": 1936.32,
    "duration": 6.64
  },
  {
    "text": "object of the holy life, its essence,",
    "start": 1939.84,
    "duration": 6.679
  },
  {
    "text": "its true goal.",
    "start": 1942.96,
    "duration": 3.559
  },
  {
    "text": "So",
    "start": 1947.279,
    "duration": 4.64
  },
  {
    "text": "the the first",
    "start": 1949.519,
    "duration": 8.321
  },
  {
    "text": "piece to say is um is about context that",
    "start": 1951.919,
    "duration": 10.401
  },
  {
    "text": "uh we talk about dharma in groups and we",
    "start": 1957.84,
    "duration": 7.439
  },
  {
    "text": "talk one-on-one",
    "start": 1962.32,
    "duration": 5.52
  },
  {
    "text": "and in speaking to a group the teacher",
    "start": 1965.279,
    "duration": 5.52
  },
  {
    "text": "is attempting to say things that",
    "start": 1967.84,
    "duration": 5.04
  },
  {
    "text": "maximize benefit that lead to the",
    "start": 1970.799,
    "duration": 5.921
  },
  {
    "text": "greatest benefit and minimizes is",
    "start": 1972.88,
    "duration": 5.919
  },
  {
    "text": "mischief.",
    "start": 1976.72,
    "duration": 6.959
  },
  {
    "text": "And that's a complex calculation.",
    "start": 1978.799,
    "duration": 9.76
  },
  {
    "text": "Keeps us on our toes all the time",
    "start": 1983.679,
    "duration": 6.48
  },
  {
    "text": "because",
    "start": 1988.559,
    "duration": 4.161
  },
  {
    "text": "every teaching can be wielded by our",
    "start": 1990.159,
    "duration": 4.321
  },
  {
    "text": "wisdom",
    "start": 1992.72,
    "duration": 3.92
  },
  {
    "text": "or by",
    "start": 1994.48,
    "duration": 6.64
  },
  {
    "text": "our bad habits.",
    "start": 1996.64,
    "duration": 6.96
  },
  {
    "text": "And in speaking one- on-one with",
    "start": 2001.12,
    "duration": 3.919
  },
  {
    "text": "somebody, the conversation could be",
    "start": 2003.6,
    "duration": 3.6
  },
  {
    "text": "quite different and the calculations are",
    "start": 2005.039,
    "duration": 4.961
  },
  {
    "text": "simpler and there might be higher levels",
    "start": 2007.2,
    "duration": 6.24
  },
  {
    "text": "of disclosure and more explicit",
    "start": 2010.0,
    "duration": 5.679
  },
  {
    "text": "conversations.",
    "start": 2013.44,
    "duration": 4.32
  },
  {
    "text": "You're meeting the needs of that that",
    "start": 2015.679,
    "duration": 4.561
  },
  {
    "text": "person rather than calibrating to a kind",
    "start": 2017.76,
    "duration": 6.72
  },
  {
    "text": "of group process.",
    "start": 2020.24,
    "duration": 6.559
  },
  {
    "text": "And uh and yet much of the dharma",
    "start": 2024.48,
    "duration": 5.84
  },
  {
    "text": "happens in the group context. And I",
    "start": 2026.799,
    "duration": 5.201
  },
  {
    "text": "still feel like there are genuine",
    "start": 2030.32,
    "duration": 5.04
  },
  {
    "text": "benefits to speaking about freedom about",
    "start": 2032.0,
    "duration": 6.159
  },
  {
    "text": "awakening.",
    "start": 2035.36,
    "duration": 5.76
  },
  {
    "text": "And uh",
    "start": 2038.159,
    "duration": 4.801
  },
  {
    "text": "it's real",
    "start": 2041.12,
    "duration": 4.32
  },
  {
    "text": "you know most change is gradual but not",
    "start": 2042.96,
    "duration": 5.76
  },
  {
    "text": "all change. So there are",
    "start": 2045.44,
    "duration": 7.199
  },
  {
    "text": "kind of um inflection points that you",
    "start": 2048.72,
    "duration": 6.32
  },
  {
    "text": "know decisively",
    "start": 2052.639,
    "duration": 6.0
  },
  {
    "text": "alter this you know spiritual trajectory",
    "start": 2055.04,
    "duration": 8.0
  },
  {
    "text": "of of a of one person's life",
    "start": 2058.639,
    "duration": 7.76
  },
  {
    "text": "and um from the Buddhist tradition of",
    "start": 2063.04,
    "duration": 7.359
  },
  {
    "text": "course but but Young described um huge",
    "start": 2066.399,
    "duration": 6.321
  },
  {
    "text": "emotional displacements and",
    "start": 2070.399,
    "duration": 4.641
  },
  {
    "text": "rearrangements",
    "start": 2072.72,
    "duration": 4.639
  },
  {
    "text": "ideas emotions and attitudes which were",
    "start": 2075.04,
    "duration": 6.639
  },
  {
    "text": "once the guiding forces of the lives of",
    "start": 2077.359,
    "duration": 6.56
  },
  {
    "text": "these people are suddenly cast to one",
    "start": 2081.679,
    "duration": 5.281
  },
  {
    "text": "side and a completely new",
    "start": 2083.919,
    "duration": 6.561
  },
  {
    "text": "set of conceptions and motives begin to",
    "start": 2086.96,
    "duration": 6.08
  },
  {
    "text": "dominate them.",
    "start": 2090.48,
    "duration": 5.84
  },
  {
    "text": "That's a kind of characterization of",
    "start": 2093.04,
    "duration": 5.52
  },
  {
    "text": "sometimes described a quant you know in",
    "start": 2096.32,
    "duration": 7.48
  },
  {
    "text": "psychology quantum changes.",
    "start": 2098.56,
    "duration": 5.24
  },
  {
    "text": "Now not speaking about awakening may",
    "start": 2106.0,
    "duration": 5.28
  },
  {
    "text": "erode people's confidence in themselves",
    "start": 2108.56,
    "duration": 6.64
  },
  {
    "text": "or make it seem like some mythical",
    "start": 2111.28,
    "duration": 6.4
  },
  {
    "text": "thing.",
    "start": 2115.2,
    "duration": 7.04
  },
  {
    "text": "And I I remember um a teacher I sat with",
    "start": 2117.68,
    "duration": 6.159
  },
  {
    "text": "for many years, Shinzen Young, saying,",
    "start": 2122.24,
    "duration": 5.52
  },
  {
    "text": "\"Don't get stuck in a good place.",
    "start": 2123.839,
    "duration": 6.24
  },
  {
    "text": "Sometimes happiness,",
    "start": 2127.76,
    "duration": 4.96
  },
  {
    "text": "some of the fruit of practice",
    "start": 2130.079,
    "duration": 7.321
  },
  {
    "text": "can breed a measure of complacency.",
    "start": 2132.72,
    "duration": 4.68
  },
  {
    "text": "Not all aspiration generates grasping",
    "start": 2140.24,
    "duration": 7.68
  },
  {
    "text": "and craving and clinging, striving.",
    "start": 2143.52,
    "duration": 8.0
  },
  {
    "text": "Often does, but not always.",
    "start": 2147.92,
    "duration": 6.48
  },
  {
    "text": "Not always. Sometimes we can hold some",
    "start": 2151.52,
    "duration": 6.559
  },
  {
    "text": "aspiration and not be deformed by the",
    "start": 2154.4,
    "duration": 7.48
  },
  {
    "text": "desperate, self-driven",
    "start": 2158.079,
    "duration": 3.801
  },
  {
    "text": "uh strive.",
    "start": 2162.16,
    "duration": 3.56
  },
  {
    "text": "Jesse um",
    "start": 2166.16,
    "duration": 6.24
  },
  {
    "text": "Jesse Vega Fry",
    "start": 2168.96,
    "duration": 5.2
  },
  {
    "text": "um",
    "start": 2172.4,
    "duration": 4.64
  },
  {
    "text": "asked this question to this revered uh",
    "start": 2174.16,
    "duration": 4.88
  },
  {
    "text": "Burmese teacher you know he said on the",
    "start": 2177.04,
    "duration": 4.16
  },
  {
    "text": "one hand there's spiritual urgency some",
    "start": 2179.04,
    "duration": 6.0
  },
  {
    "text": "Vega on the other hand there's patience",
    "start": 2181.2,
    "duration": 7.36
  },
  {
    "text": "so this like real urgency and patience",
    "start": 2185.04,
    "duration": 5.2
  },
  {
    "text": "and it's like how do these two fit",
    "start": 2188.56,
    "duration": 3.36
  },
  {
    "text": "together",
    "start": 2190.24,
    "duration": 4.96
  },
  {
    "text": "and Sida's response was you should have",
    "start": 2191.92,
    "duration": 4.4
  },
  {
    "text": "some vega",
    "start": 2195.2,
    "duration": 4.52
  },
  {
    "text": "and patience.",
    "start": 2196.32,
    "duration": 3.4
  },
  {
    "text": "No problem.",
    "start": 2199.839,
    "duration": 3.321
  },
  {
    "text": "Not all um aspiration is drenched in",
    "start": 2205.68,
    "duration": 5.919
  },
  {
    "text": "selfw.",
    "start": 2209.44,
    "duration": 6.24
  },
  {
    "text": "Some longings do emerge from the heart",
    "start": 2211.599,
    "duration": 8.0
  },
  {
    "text": "and they tend to be kind of vagger, less",
    "start": 2215.68,
    "duration": 6.24
  },
  {
    "text": "transactional. They're outside of the",
    "start": 2219.599,
    "duration": 6.281
  },
  {
    "text": "logic of self.",
    "start": 2221.92,
    "duration": 3.96
  },
  {
    "text": "And an explicit um focus on awakening",
    "start": 2226.88,
    "duration": 8.4
  },
  {
    "text": "can help us stop tinkering with our",
    "start": 2230.88,
    "duration": 6.479
  },
  {
    "text": "conditioning.",
    "start": 2235.28,
    "duration": 5.76
  },
  {
    "text": "You know, it can help us um cut through",
    "start": 2237.359,
    "duration": 7.281
  },
  {
    "text": "the tendency to just keep making small",
    "start": 2241.04,
    "duration": 6.72
  },
  {
    "text": "modifications to this self model rather",
    "start": 2244.64,
    "duration": 4.719
  },
  {
    "text": "than",
    "start": 2247.76,
    "duration": 6.4
  },
  {
    "text": "step out. You know, Ziger Kungch said",
    "start": 2249.359,
    "duration": 7.201
  },
  {
    "text": "you want to keep rearranging the",
    "start": 2254.16,
    "duration": 7.24
  },
  {
    "text": "furniture of your dream or wake up.",
    "start": 2256.56,
    "duration": 4.84
  },
  {
    "text": "And um",
    "start": 2262.16,
    "duration": 3.72
  },
  {
    "text": "it's important for us to know that much",
    "start": 2266.48,
    "duration": 4.8
  },
  {
    "text": "of what we consider",
    "start": 2269.2,
    "duration": 6.68
  },
  {
    "text": "the first arrow is the second.",
    "start": 2271.28,
    "duration": 4.6
  },
  {
    "text": "and that we might know forms of of peace",
    "start": 2277.839,
    "duration": 7.041
  },
  {
    "text": "and well-being that that we haven't",
    "start": 2281.28,
    "duration": 6.319
  },
  {
    "text": "really imagined.",
    "start": 2284.88,
    "duration": 6.28
  },
  {
    "text": "Hard to imagine",
    "start": 2287.599,
    "duration": 3.561
  },
  {
    "text": "that this world is so um",
    "start": 2291.76,
    "duration": 6.599
  },
  {
    "text": "so overflowing with u mystery,",
    "start": 2299.44,
    "duration": 7.88
  },
  {
    "text": "majesty",
    "start": 2304.32,
    "duration": 3.0
  },
  {
    "text": "makes you want to bow down",
    "start": 2307.839,
    "duration": 4.041
  },
  {
    "text": "and there are complications.",
    "start": 2313.76,
    "duration": 3.64
  },
  {
    "text": "And so complications about talking",
    "start": 2318.0,
    "duration": 7.359
  },
  {
    "text": "explicitly about awakening.",
    "start": 2321.119,
    "duration": 8.801
  },
  {
    "text": "And in a way I want to",
    "start": 2325.359,
    "duration": 8.081
  },
  {
    "text": "respect the many different",
    "start": 2329.92,
    "duration": 6.32
  },
  {
    "text": "fruits of dharma practice and not",
    "start": 2333.44,
    "duration": 5.12
  },
  {
    "text": "elevate awakening",
    "start": 2336.24,
    "duration": 4.48
  },
  {
    "text": "in such a way that it's the only fruit",
    "start": 2338.56,
    "duration": 4.72
  },
  {
    "text": "that matters.",
    "start": 2340.72,
    "duration": 6.72
  },
  {
    "text": "This is maybe me personally, but uh I",
    "start": 2343.28,
    "duration": 8.4
  },
  {
    "text": "I'm sort of equally touched by many",
    "start": 2347.44,
    "duration": 7.52
  },
  {
    "text": "kinds of letting go, many kinds of",
    "start": 2351.68,
    "duration": 5.919
  },
  {
    "text": "healing.",
    "start": 2354.96,
    "duration": 5.36
  },
  {
    "text": "And sometimes the most, you know,",
    "start": 2357.599,
    "duration": 5.681
  },
  {
    "text": "beautiful growth comes when",
    "start": 2360.32,
    "duration": 6.16
  },
  {
    "text": "just huge chunks of psychological",
    "start": 2363.28,
    "duration": 4.72
  },
  {
    "text": "conditioning",
    "start": 2366.48,
    "duration": 5.599
  },
  {
    "text": "fall away. It's not awakening",
    "start": 2368.0,
    "duration": 6.64
  },
  {
    "text": "but",
    "start": 2372.079,
    "duration": 5.681
  },
  {
    "text": "every bit as beautiful",
    "start": 2374.64,
    "duration": 6.68
  },
  {
    "text": "to my mind.",
    "start": 2377.76,
    "duration": 3.56
  },
  {
    "text": "And talking about awakening is very",
    "start": 2381.68,
    "duration": 5.36
  },
  {
    "text": "tricky because it's almost always maybe",
    "start": 2383.76,
    "duration": 6.079
  },
  {
    "text": "the default uh kind of way of",
    "start": 2387.04,
    "duration": 5.6
  },
  {
    "text": "approaching it. It's envisioned from the",
    "start": 2389.839,
    "duration": 7.401
  },
  {
    "text": "perspective of self view",
    "start": 2392.64,
    "duration": 4.6
  },
  {
    "text": "and and",
    "start": 2397.52,
    "duration": 3.16
  },
  {
    "text": "that and that it becomes a kind of um we",
    "start": 2400.8,
    "duration": 8.48
  },
  {
    "text": "c we can't imagine it as anything but a",
    "start": 2406.16,
    "duration": 8.199
  },
  {
    "text": "kind of autrammont of the self.",
    "start": 2409.28,
    "duration": 5.079
  },
  {
    "text": "An awakening seems like a kind of the",
    "start": 2415.119,
    "duration": 5.441
  },
  {
    "text": "solution to one's problems rather than a",
    "start": 2417.92,
    "duration": 8.08
  },
  {
    "text": "kaleidoscopic shift in which our",
    "start": 2420.56,
    "duration": 8.24
  },
  {
    "text": "quote problems appear entirely",
    "start": 2426.0,
    "duration": 5.8
  },
  {
    "text": "differently.",
    "start": 2428.8,
    "duration": 3.0
  },
  {
    "text": "And generally speaking, the people who",
    "start": 2433.44,
    "duration": 4.96
  },
  {
    "text": "have awakening",
    "start": 2436.48,
    "duration": 5.68
  },
  {
    "text": "experiences do not care narrowly about",
    "start": 2438.4,
    "duration": 5.52
  },
  {
    "text": "awakening.",
    "start": 2442.16,
    "duration": 7.679
  },
  {
    "text": "They care about truth and renunciation",
    "start": 2443.92,
    "duration": 11.12
  },
  {
    "text": "and awareness and honoring re, you know,",
    "start": 2449.839,
    "duration": 8.0
  },
  {
    "text": "an expression of reverence",
    "start": 2455.04,
    "duration": 5.6
  },
  {
    "text": "for the",
    "start": 2457.839,
    "duration": 8.28
  },
  {
    "text": "exquisite beauty of the dharma.",
    "start": 2460.64,
    "duration": 5.479
  },
  {
    "text": "They care about love.",
    "start": 2466.319,
    "duration": 3.641
  },
  {
    "text": "They don't care.",
    "start": 2470.96,
    "duration": 3.56
  },
  {
    "text": "They don't even care what they learn,",
    "start": 2474.72,
    "duration": 8.0
  },
  {
    "text": "how they're changed, what they get.",
    "start": 2478.0,
    "duration": 7.52
  },
  {
    "text": "They are simply walking",
    "start": 2482.72,
    "duration": 6.119
  },
  {
    "text": "a path",
    "start": 2485.52,
    "duration": 3.319
  },
  {
    "text": "and all the gifts are almost incidental.",
    "start": 2490.0,
    "duration": 6.119
  },
  {
    "text": "And so deeper freedom is not it's not a",
    "start": 2496.88,
    "duration": 6.8
  },
  {
    "text": "transaction. It's a very deep suspension",
    "start": 2499.92,
    "duration": 9.0
  },
  {
    "text": "of the bartering mode of existence.",
    "start": 2503.68,
    "duration": 5.24
  },
  {
    "text": "And it's tricky to talk about awakening",
    "start": 2511.44,
    "duration": 5.2
  },
  {
    "text": "because",
    "start": 2514.88,
    "duration": 4.479
  },
  {
    "text": "you're talking to a self, but it's not",
    "start": 2516.64,
    "duration": 6.08
  },
  {
    "text": "you, the one planning the progress that",
    "start": 2519.359,
    "duration": 6.24
  },
  {
    "text": "inherits the progress.",
    "start": 2522.72,
    "duration": 6.24
  },
  {
    "text": "And that self is um",
    "start": 2525.599,
    "duration": 7.801
  },
  {
    "text": "long gone once there's progress.",
    "start": 2528.96,
    "duration": 4.44
  },
  {
    "text": "And causality is complex. It's hard to",
    "start": 2536.88,
    "duration": 7.04
  },
  {
    "text": "know. It's hard to draw straight lines",
    "start": 2540.16,
    "duration": 9.12
  },
  {
    "text": "from the from one insight, one process",
    "start": 2543.92,
    "duration": 8.8
  },
  {
    "text": "in the heart.",
    "start": 2549.28,
    "duration": 5.76
  },
  {
    "text": "It's hard to draw lines from one of",
    "start": 2552.72,
    "duration": 3.84
  },
  {
    "text": "those",
    "start": 2555.04,
    "duration": 3.76
  },
  {
    "text": "things to",
    "start": 2556.56,
    "duration": 4.96
  },
  {
    "text": "the the the effect. It's hard to draw",
    "start": 2558.8,
    "duration": 5.68
  },
  {
    "text": "the lines of cause and effect. We think",
    "start": 2561.52,
    "duration": 4.96
  },
  {
    "text": "we can do it easily, but it's not so",
    "start": 2564.48,
    "duration": 5.0
  },
  {
    "text": "simple.",
    "start": 2566.48,
    "duration": 3.0
  },
  {
    "text": "It's hard to know um",
    "start": 2570.319,
    "duration": 6.961
  },
  {
    "text": "the counterfactual of where our life was",
    "start": 2574.16,
    "duration": 6.8
  },
  {
    "text": "going were it not for this or that. It's",
    "start": 2577.28,
    "duration": 7.039
  },
  {
    "text": "hard to know.",
    "start": 2580.96,
    "duration": 5.6
  },
  {
    "text": "And so it's complicated. It's",
    "start": 2584.319,
    "duration": 4.321
  },
  {
    "text": "complicated.",
    "start": 2586.56,
    "duration": 4.96
  },
  {
    "text": "And uh as a",
    "start": 2588.64,
    "duration": 5.199
  },
  {
    "text": "temperamentally ambivalent kind of",
    "start": 2591.52,
    "duration": 3.92
  },
  {
    "text": "character,",
    "start": 2593.839,
    "duration": 3.921
  },
  {
    "text": "maybe cautious,",
    "start": 2595.44,
    "duration": 6.159
  },
  {
    "text": "um I uh feel the need to speak to both",
    "start": 2597.76,
    "duration": 6.8
  },
